Real-time kanban board with Go, Gin, and Supabase.

Tasks are stored in Supabase Postgres. Row Level Security (RLS) is enabled by
the migration in `supabase/migrations`; requests must include a Supabase user
access token so PostgREST evaluates policies as that user.

## API

- `GET /users/:user_id/tasks` lists tasks for a user.
- `POST /tasks` creates a task.
- `GET /tasks/:task_id` gets a task by ID.

Set `SUPABASE_URL` and `SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` in `.env`. Never use the
Supabase secret key in this application; it bypasses RLS.

Run the server with:

```powershell
go run .
```

Run tests with:

```powershell
go test ./...
```